Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:02.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1440)}So it sounds\Nlike to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.66,0:00:05.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1440)}you're helping doctors\Nto become {\c&H004BA2C9&}doctorpreneurs.{\c&H00DDEBF3&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:07.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1440)}It is. You took the\Nwords out of my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1440)}That's the\Ntransformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:11.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}What was the best\Nlesson you learned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:12.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}from all that\Nrejection?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:16.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}I think the best\Nlesson that I learned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}was that when\NI overcome,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.31,0:00:20.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}other people\Ncan overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:25.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}When I overcome,\Nothers overcome too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:26.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}It's contagious,\Nisn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:28.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}It's contagious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.91,0:00:30.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}There was a point\Nwhere you had to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:32.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}overcome some\Nsort of barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:35.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}in order to dig\Ndeeper into yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.53,0:00:37.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}What do you think\Nhad to go for you to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.77,0:00:39.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}be able to dig deeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:41.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}Stubbornness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.01,0:00:45.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}My {\c&H004BA2C9&}ego.{\c&H00DDEBF3&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:49.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}How did you find your\Nway to {\c&H004BA2C9&}forgiveness?{\c&H00DDEBF3&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.03,0:00:50.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}I know that's not\Nin the script here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:52.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}but that's coming\Nfrom my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.23,0:00:53.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.11,0:00:55.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}It took a lot\Nof prayer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:56.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:57.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}It took a lot\Nof journaling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.79,0:01:00.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}So I just want people\Nto be able to know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.51,0:01:02.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}that they can\Nexpress their self
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.35,0:01:06.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}in that outlet and\Nfeel safe and heard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:09.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}and understood in\Na safe environment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.53,0:01:11.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}that they can create\Nfor their selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.39,0:01:13.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}Safe, heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.75,0:01:14.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}And understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.43,0:01:16.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}And understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.27,0:01:18.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}You are with this\Npodcast and this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:21.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}space, bringing\Nexperts together to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.77,0:01:23.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}teach them the thing\Nthat school didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.13,0:01:25.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)}teach them, which is how\Nto {\c&H004BA2C9&}question{\c&H00DDEBF3&} {\c&H004BA2C9&}everything.{\c&H00DDEBF3&}
